# Fraudebot

Fraudebot is a platform where users can search if the person they're talking to have reports made by other users, preventing them to be scammed.
Users can use the implemented search engine to query by using the card number, CLABE (SPEI), crypto wallets, so on. The idea came from the abandoned project [Estafabot] (https://www.facebook.com/estafabotmx/), which featured a search engine along a Whatsapp Bot to search through the database.

As I said earlier, **Estafabot** was abandoned, no reason at all, and lastly the scams about car sales, investments, crypto, loans, general sales, etc, have incremented exponentially on internet, so
this project presents a solution for this by allowing all users to search through the database at no cost.

# Objectives

- **Report Form**: Allow users to submit reports to scammers/organizations. More about this in domain/reports.mdc
- **View Scammer/Organization page**: Allow users to view the information of a scammer/organization that was reported before by other users.
- **Whatsapp Bot**: This is an upcoming project, but we will allow users to search information about scammers/organizations on Whatsapp.

